{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The restaurant is bustling with customers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;RippleIsland Kyle and Cal\u2019s Restaurant&quot; is a cooperative cooking action game for up to 16 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with the unique animals of Ripple Island to serve up delicious dishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To cook any dish, you first need to gather ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow vegetables, catch fish, collect eggs from your pets... Gather ingredients in all sorts of ways and show off your cooking skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon an unknown sea floats an unknown island: Ripple Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by rich nature, the island was blessed with an abundance of fresh, delicious ingredients and was home to many skilled chefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/20745321a222326e8eb38bd95183eeee.avif?t=1764168965\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a question popped into the head of the island's king, <strong>Dotella</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What is the most delicious dish on this island?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the answer, King <strong>Dotella</strong> issued a proclamation to all the chefs on the island:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A cooking tournament will be held to decide the greatest chef on the island! Whoever creates the best dish will be rewarded with a grand treasure!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/183caddaee842c4a0d9094aa094b8334.avif?t=1764168965\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This proclamation reached the ears of Kyle, a chef living on the outskirts of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kyle, who had always dreamed of making it big, immediately got ready and set off for the castle where the tournament would be held.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/c7167e9f82121272542dd0d813441df4.avif?t=1764168965\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Challenge Mode, you can play with up to 4 players in local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your family and friends to beat each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everyone's Restaurant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy massive co-op fun with up to 16 players online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork and dividing tasks are the keys to conquering up to 6 stages within the time limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also have up to 8 local players join an online session together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into online multiplayer and have a blast with your family and friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Ways to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From gathering ingredients to cooking, serving, and cleaning, you'll do it all by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for victory by making the best decisions while running the entire operation solo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>16-Player Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't clear these stages without delegating roles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to success is to watch your teammates' actions and figure out the best way you can contribute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now... Let's get cooking! \ud83c\udf73</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u3082\u3050\u3082\u3050\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/ebf1bee15176c2c43c700199229f70c459b6b58e.jpg"},{"name":"\u3082\u3050\u3082\u3050\u30ad\u30e3\u30d7\u30c6\u30f3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/46a0e3cc1fdfd4699e7c19e99cb09a0baa52a4fe.jpg"},{"name":"\u3082\u3050\u3082\u3050\u30c7\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/a4dc39b683c6e3a25146ae2e252519e472b6f0bc.jpg"},{"name":"\u305c\u3093\u3076\u3067\u304d\u305f\u3088","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/bff47ed5d208deb3dfa6502251e1af0b54272c40.jpg"},{"name":"\u304d\u3089\u304d\u3089\u661f\u30b3\u30ec\u30af\u30bf\u30fc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/2923b9c6155b30b4b361e42d683eb82fd2fe8d0a.jpg"},{"name":"\u30a8\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u307f\u305f\u3088\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/317b429f330c2269473a24b934de92d8829e08ca.jpg"},{"name":"\u30af\u30ec\u30b8\u30c3\u30c8\u307f\u305f\u3088\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/80c1106fd382a01e0d63f585cf43c072ffed1b6c.jpg"},{"name":"\u3069\u3093\u3050\u308a\u5927\u5bcc\u8c6a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/9b7af1924f96f1c234405453ea0d5707f044b921.jpg"},{"name":"\u3069\u3093\u3050\u308a\u5bcc\u8c6a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844150/c4b0c39c4dc57ba5786c228c6bb2f9981a070a7e.jpg"},{"name":"\u3069\u3093\u3050\u308a\u307d\u3063\u3051","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu